# a drum kit set on a part (kit=, a sound command once the net lands)
tempo 128
deck A: kick x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ kit=drums-808 | hihat ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ | clap ~ ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~
deck B: bass a1 ~ a1 ~ c2 ~ a1 ~ e1 ~ a1 ~ g1 ~ a1 ~ inst=sub-bass | harmony <chord(am) chord(f) chord(c) chord(g)> inst=warm-pad
end at bar 8
